fo=&#8221;{}&#8221;][\/et_pb_divider][et_pb_blurb icon_placement=&#8221;left&#8221; content_max_width=&#8221;1100px&#8221; _builder_version=&#8221;4.17.3&#8243; _module_preset=&#8221;default&#8221; header_level=&#8221;h5&#8243; header_font=&#8221;Titillium Web|700||on|||||&#8221; header_font_size=&#8221;18px&#8221; header_letter_spacing=&#8221;2px&#8221; header_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; body_font=&#8221;Source Sans Pro||||||||&#8221; body_text_color=&#8221;rgba(255,255,255,0.7)&#8221; body_font_size=&#8221;16px&#8221; body_line_height=&#8221;1.8em&#8221; background_color=&#8221;rgba(60,60,200,0.2)&#8221; background_layout=&#8221;dark&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;30px|16px|30px|16px&#8221; animation_style=&#8221;fold&#8221; animation_delay=&#8221;200ms&#8221; hover_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243; border_width_all=&#8221;2px&#8221; border_color_all=&#8221;#4328B7&#8243; box_shadow_style=&#8221;preset1&#8243; box_shadow_blur=&#8221;60px&#8221; box_shadow_color=&#8221;rgba(60,60,200,0.4)&#8221; global_colors_info=&#8221;{}&#8221; sticky_enabled=&#8221;0&#8243;]<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\"><strong>Preparation of Final Manuscript Submission<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgba(224, 43, 32, 0.7); font-size: x-large;\"><strong>5 STEPS are required to complete the Final Paper Submissio<\/strong><\/span><strong style=\"color: rgba(224, 43, 32, 0.7); font-size: x-large;\">n<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: large; color: rgba(224, 43, 32, 0.7);\">STEP 1:<\/span>\u00a0 Use IEEE templates for your papers (latex or word). Templates are in this link: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ieee.org\/conferences\/publishing\/templates.html\">https:\/\/www.ieee.org\/conferences\/publishing\/templates.html<\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ieee.org\/conferences\/publishing\/templates.html\"><\/a><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: large; color: rgba(224, 43, 32, 0.7);\">STEP 2:<\/span>\u00a0 Add the copyright notice to the bottom of the first page of your source docu<\/strong><strong>ment.<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><strong style=\"font-size: x-large; text-align: center;\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture1.png\" width=\"90%\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-448 alignnone size-medium\" srcset=\"wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture1.png 904w, wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture1-480x92.png 480w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 904px, 100vw\" \/><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"> <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Screenshot-2566-03-22-at-17.12.53.png\" width=\"90%\"  alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-465 alignnone size-full\" srcset=\"wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Screenshot-2566-03-22-at-17.12.53.png 2230w, wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Screenshot-2566-03-22-at-17.12.53-1280x711.png 1280w, wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Screenshot-2566-03-22-at-17.12.53-980x544.png 980w, wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Screenshot-2566-03-22-at-17.12.53-480x266.png 480w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) and (max-width: 1280px) 1280px, (min-width: 1281px) 2230px, 100vw\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: large; color: rgba(224, 43, 32, 0.7);\">STEP 3:<\/span> Convert to PDF using IEEE PDF eXpress<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">Authors must create a PDF according to the IEEE PDF Specification for IEEE Xplore. All submissions MUST be IEEE Xplore compliant and the only way to ensure this is to use IEEE&#8217;s PDF eXpress. Authors must check their papers for ECTICON 2023 using the IEEE PDF eXpress system at <a href=\"https:\/\/ieee-pdf-express.org\/\">https:\/\/ieee-pdf-express.org\/<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal; color: rgba(224, 43, 32, 0.7);\"><strong>Please note that, the IEEE PDF eXpress site will be opened on <u>April 3, 2023<\/u>.<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal; color: rgba(224, 43, 32, 0.7);\"><strong>ECTICON2023 Conference ID:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 58255X<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal; color: rgba(224, 43, 32, 0.7);\"><strong><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>IEEE PDF eXpress process overview<\/strong>: (more information can be found at <a href=\"https:\/\/ieee-pdf-express.org\/External\/UsingIEEEPDFeXpress\">https:\/\/ieee-pdf-express.org\/External\/UsingIEEEPDFeXpress<\/a>)<\/span><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">Create a IEEE PDFeXpress\u00ae account, entering basic contact information; gets confirmation of account creation email.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">Upload a PDF for Checking or source file(s) for Conversion; get email confirmation of file receipt.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">Submitted PDFs are Checked for IEEE Xplore\u00ae-compatibility; source file(s) are Converted to IEEE Xplore-compatible PDFs.<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"> If a PDF is submitted: you will receive an email stating that PDF Passed or Failed the Check. If the PDF fails, a PDF Check report is attached to the email. Author goes to account and clicks &#8220;Understanding the PDF Check Report&#8221; for solutions.<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"> If source is submitted: you will receive the IEEE PDFeXpress\u00ae-generated PDF as an attachment, and through your IEEE PDFeXpress\u00ae account. Review PDF to ensure that it views on screen and prints as you intended.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">If necessary, revisions may be submitted (PDF or source); return to Step 2.<\/span><br \/>\n<span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"> Make sure that there are no grammatical, spelling,<br \/>\nor content errors in articles prior to submitting to PDFeXpress.<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">When you have an acceptable IEEE Xplore-compatible PDF, submit this final PDF to the conference by clicking Approve button. Before that, submit the electronic copyright form by clicking Copyright link.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: large; color: rgba(224, 43, 32, 0.7);\">STEP 4:<\/span> submit your final camera ready as PDF to the ECTICON 2023 submission system at <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/edas.info\/N30174\">https:\/\/edas.info\/N30174<\/a> <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">Select your paper that you want to submit final manuscript<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">Click on the \u201cup arrow button\u201d , under the \u201cFinal manuscript (camera-ready version)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture3.png\" width=\"90%\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-454 alignnone size-medium\" srcset=\"wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture3.png 602w, wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture3-480x255.png 480w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 602px, 100vw\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">Then, submit your final manuscript.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: large; color: rgba(224, 43, 32, 0.7);\">STEP 5: <\/span>complete the IEEE copyright transfer. <\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">Please note that, before submitting your final manuscript the authors must first upload or fill out the IEEE copyright form.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">Click \u201cupload or fill out\u201d<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture4.png\" width=\"90%\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-456 alignnone size-full\" srcset=\"wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture4.png 602w, wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture4-480x198.png 480w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 602px, 100vw\" \/>\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">Click \u201cIEEE copyright submission\u201d<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\"> <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture5.png\" width=\"90%\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-458 alignnone size-medium\" srcset=\"wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture5.png 602w, wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture5-480x144.png 480w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 602px, 100vw\" \/><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: normal;\">Then, follows the steps to transfer copyright to IEEE<\/span><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture6.png\" width=\"90%\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-459 alignnone size-full\" srcset=\"wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture6.png 602w, wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/03\/Picture6-480x244.png 480w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) 602px, 100vw\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span><\/span>[\/et_pb_blurb][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Camera Ready Paper SubmissionPreparation of Final Manuscript Submission 5 STEPS are required to complete the Final Paper Submission STEP 1:\u00a0 Use IEEE templates for your papers (latex or word). Templates are in this link: https:\/\/www.ieee.org\/conferences\/publishing\/templates.html STEP 2:\u00a0 Add the copyright notice to the bottom of the first page of your source document. STEP 3: Convert [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_et_pb_use_builder":"on","_et_pb_old_content":"","_et_gb_content_width":"","footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-154","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/ecticon2023.ecticon.org\/index.php?rest_route=\/wp\/v2\/pages\/154","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/ecticon2023.ecticon.org\/index.php?rest_route=\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/ecticon2023.ecticon.org\/index.php?rest_route=\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ecticon2023.ecticon.org\/index.php?rest_route=\/wp\/v2\/users\/2"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/ecticon2023.ecticon.org\/index.php?rest_route=%2Fwp%2Fv2%2Fc